<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Loki Katars SL+SS</Major>
    <Description>macro automates a side light into side signature combo for Loki using katars, with default keyboard and mouse settings. 
It uses M1 (left mouse button) for the side light and M2 (right mouse button) for the side signature.

Must be on left side of opponent, facing right to execute correctly.
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 7 1
Delay 40 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 40 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 0 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 40 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 71 ms
KeyUp 7 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Brawlhalla</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>